PART A.2  the five invariants T1..T5 (own Christoffel code): static weak-field values and the tuned subspace (part of C4)
====================================================================================================
  T1(static) = 3*p**2 + 7*q**2   [p = d dPhi, q = d dPsi]
  T2(static) = p**2 - 2*p*q + q**2   [p = d dPhi, q = d dPsi]
  T3(static) = p**2 - 6*p*q + 9*q**2   [p = d dPhi, q = d dPsi]
  T4(static) = -p**2 - q**2   [p = d dPhi, q = d dPsi]
  T5(static) = -p**2 + 4*p*q - 3*q**2   [p = d dPhi, q = d dPsi]
  tuned family: T_tuned(static) = (-4*u0 - 2*u1) p^2 + (-8*u0 - 8*u1) q^2 + (8*u1) p q
  [PASS] (control) C4 static coefficients a = -4u0-2u1, b = -8(u0+u1), x = 8u1 (the record's values, re-derived with own code)   (a=-4*u0 - 2*u1, b=-8*u0 - 8*u1, x=8*u1)
  [PASS] (control) T4-T1 static = -4(p^2 + 2 q^2): Q = -T/a0^2 = 4(|d dPhi|^2 + 2|d dPsi|^2)/a0^2 (frozen 1.1)   (T4-T1 = -4*p**2 - 8*q**2)

